premise[fact] P10:commit-c6aa570-cludia-cli-could-create-edit-inspect ::T "At commit c6aa570, Cludia's CLI could create, edit, inspect, validate, and derive multi-premise AND inferences."

premise[fact] P11:commit-c6aa570-discovery-workspace-contained-three-connected-reasoning ::T "At commit c6aa570, the discovery workspace contained three connected reasoning components, but Cludia could not list those components directly."

premise[value] P12:when-dogfooding-requires-agent-reconstruct-existing-reasoning-components ::T "When dogfooding requires an agent to reconstruct existing reasoning components manually, the next query slice should expose those components directly."

lemma[value] L5:cludia-next-implementation-slice-should-add-connected-component "At the post-c6aa570 checkpoint, the inspection gap warranted implementing connected-component listing as Cludia's next slice."
