premise[fact] P13:component-listing-review-checkpoint-2026-08-24-cludia ::T "At the component-listing review checkpoint on 2026-08-24, Cludia could list every connected component and inspect the complete component containing a statement, slug, or junctor."

premise[fact] P14:between-commit-c6aa570-component-listing-checkpoint-no-previously ::T "Between commit c6aa570 and the component-listing checkpoint, no previously implemented Cludia CLI capability was removed."

lemma[fact] L6:component-listing-checkpoint-cludia-supported-workspace-creation "At the component-listing checkpoint, Cludia supported workspace creation, statement capture and editing, listing, inspection, validation, multi-premise AND derivation, and component discovery."
