premise[fact] P15:commit-b516a86-locating-statements-wording-required-reading-externally ::T "At commit b516a86, locating statements by wording required reading or externally filtering the complete list output because Cludia had no search command."

premise[value] P16:workspaces-grow-next-read-query-priority-should-eliminate ::T "As workspaces grow, the next read/query priority should eliminate whole-workspace scanning for a known word, phrase, ID, or slug."

lemma[value] L7:statement-search-justified-cludia-next-read-query-slice "At the post-b516a86 checkpoint, the whole-workspace scanning gap warranted statement search as Cludia's next read/query slice."
