premise[fact] P17:commit-b516a86-cludia-could-create-inference-but-could ::T "At commit b516a86, Cludia could create an AND inference but could not add or remove its sources or remove the junctor."

premise[value] P18:after-inference-creation-works-authors-should-be-able ::T "After inference creation works, authors should be able to repair a persisted inference when an audit reveals a missing or unnecessary premise."

lemma[value] L8:inference-repair-justified-cludia-next-construction-slice "At the post-b516a86 checkpoint, the inability to modify persisted AND inferences warranted inference repair as Cludia's next construction slice."
  <- AND#J8(P17, P18)

premise[value] P19:among-required-missing-features-next-slice-should-prioritize ::T "Among required missing features, the next slice should prioritize friction already encountered in dogfooding."

lemma[value] L9:cludia-should-implement-statement-search-before-inference-repair "At the post-b516a86 checkpoint, statement search was the warranted implementation priority before inference repair."
