premise[fact] P20:statement-search-review-checkpoint-2026-08-24-cludia ::T "At the statement-search review checkpoint on 2026-08-24, Cludia could search statement IDs, slugs, and text by case-insensitive substring while preserving document order."

premise[fact] P21:inference-repair-review-checkpoint-2026-08-24-cludia ::T "At the inference-repair review checkpoint on 2026-08-24, Cludia could add a source, remove a source while preserving at least two, and remove a junctor without leaving an undercut dangling."

premise[fact] P22:commit-d1a2f3b-cludia-could-capture-query-derive-repair ::T "At commit d1a2f3b, Cludia could capture, query, derive, and repair affirmative reasoning but could not author or remove defeats."

premise[value] P23:full-investigation-must-preserve-material-challenges-premises-inferences ::T "A full investigation must preserve material challenges to premises, inferences, and other challenges."

premise[fact] P24:cludia-v1-requires-premise-undermines-inference-undercuts-counterpoints ::T "Cludia v1 requires premise undermines, inference undercuts, and counterpoints targeting counterpoints as first-class defeat scopes."

lemma[value] L10:defeat-authoring-removal-are-required-before-cludia-can "At the post-d1a2f3b checkpoint, the inability to author defeats warranted defeat authoring and removal before a full investigation."
  <- AND#J10(P22, P23, P24)

premise[fact] P25:defeat-authoring-review-checkpoint-2026-08-24-cludia ::T "At the defeat-authoring review checkpoint on 2026-08-24, Cludia could author and remove premise undermines, inference undercuts, and counterpoints targeting counterpoints."

premise[fact] P26:commit-fbfbeb5-cludia-could-author-remove-defeats-but ::T "At commit fbfbeb5, Cludia could author and remove defeats but could only edit statement text and could not delete a statement."

premise[value] P27:full-investigation-must-be-able-correct-statement-truth ::T "A full investigation must be able to correct a statement's truth or kind and remove capture mistakes with a structural preview."

premise[fact] P28:cludia-v1-requires-truth-kind-changes-plus-statement ::T "Cludia v1 requires truth and kind changes plus statement deletion with a dry-run plan of incident relations and resulting components."

lemma[value] L11:statement-truth-kind-editing-plus-dry-run-deletion "At the post-fbfbeb5 checkpoint, missing statement truth/kind editing and structural deletion warranted the next investigation slice."
