premise[fact] P37:proposed-adr-0007-its-paired-strict-concludia-argument ::F "Proposed ADR 0007 and its paired strict Concludia argument capture the distinction among stable statement identity, mutable wording, optional slugs, and material replacement."

premise[value] P38:statement-identity-semantics-should-be-reviewed-before-cli ::T "Statement identity semantics should be reviewed before the CLI requires continuity intent or introduces slug refactoring."

