premise[fact] P40:accepted-adr-0007-its-paired-strict-concludia-argument ::T "Accepted ADR 0007 and its paired strict Concludia argument establish the distinction among stable statement identity, mutable wording, optional slugs, and material replacement."

lemma[value] L15:immediate-next-step-commit-accepted-adr-0007-before "The immediate next step is to commit accepted ADR 0007 before implementing identity guidance or slug refactoring."
