premise[fact] P41:accepted-adr-0007-applies-statement-identity-slug-semantics ::T "Accepted ADR 0007 applies statement identity and slug semantics independently of any particular workspace organization or use case."

premise[value] P42:agent-identity-guidance-should-explain-mutation-semantics-without ::T "Agent identity guidance should explain mutation semantics without assuming that users maintain separate current-state and historical-reasoning files."

premise[fact] P43:dual-current-state-historical-reasoning-workspace-documented-one ::T "A dual current-state and historical-reasoning workspace is documented as one optional incident-investigation use case rather than a Cludia profile or invariant."

