premise[fact] P44:adr-0007-implementation-review-checkpoint-2026-08-24 ::T "At the ADR 0007 implementation review checkpoint on 2026-08-24, Cludia required explicit same-proposition intent for text edits, supported mutable optional slugs, and exposed use-case-neutral machine-readable identity guidance."

premise[fact] P45:adr-0007-implementation-deliberately-leaves-identifier-reuse-after ::T "ADR 0007's implementation deliberately leaves identifier reuse after deletion unresolved and adds no tombstone or allocator metadata."

premise[value] P46:evidence-full-investigation-pilot-should-decide-whether-deleted ::T "Evidence from the full-investigation pilot should decide whether deleted IDs require permanent retirement or a separate opaque identity and display-label model."

